From: Shyalya <shyalya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:07:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Playerbots: do not equip items that contribute nothing

An item with no stats, no armour, no weapon damage and no spell fell through to ITEM_USAGE_BAD_EQUIP, which bots without a real player master put on regardless. On this realm 74 bots were wearing a Forever-Lovely Rose on their head and another 34 a rabbit headband or a carnival mask. Shirt and tabard are cosmetic slots and stay exempt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../strategy/values/ItemUsageValue.cpp          | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/modules/PlayerBots/playerbot/strategy/values/ItemUsageValue.cpp b/src/modules/PlayerBots/playerbot/strategy/values/ItemUsageValue.cpp
index 0842269..36eeeff 100644
--- a/src/modules/PlayerBots/playerbot/strategy/values/ItemUsageValue.cpp
+++ b/src/modules/PlayerBots/playerbot/strategy/values/ItemUsageValue.cpp
@@ -647,6 +647,23 @@ ItemUsage ItemUsageValue::QueryItemUsageForEquip(ItemQualifier& itemQualifier, P
     }
 
 
+    // An item with no stats, no armour, no weapon damage and no spell does
+    // nothing for the bot. Without this it falls through to BAD_EQUIP below,
+    // which bots without a real player master happily put on - that is how 74
+    // of them ended up wearing a Forever-Lovely Rose on their head and another
+    // 34 a rabbit headband or a carnival mask. Shirt and tabard are cosmetic
+    // slots and stay exempt.
+    if (!statWeight && slot != EQUIPMENT_SLOT_BODY && slot != EQUIPMENT_SLOT_TABARD)
+    {
+        bool const contributes = itemProto->Armor > 0
+            || itemProto->Block > 0
+            || itemProto->Damage[0].DamageMax > 0.0f
+            || itemProto->Spells[0].SpellId > 0;
+
+        if (!contributes)
+            return ItemUsage::ITEM_USAGE_NONE;
+    }
+
     //No item equiped
     if (!oldItem)
     {
